    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah... it's just so tiring. the pretending, the trying to find a reason to stay when there isn't one. it feels like i'm just waiting for something that's never gonna happen. do you think it's wrong to just... want it all to stop? to just not have to exist in this empty space anymore?",
